OL,3,GNEWSAAgeing swimming pool closes over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming pool has been closed
OL,7,Findefinitely for public safety after
OL,8,Fsurveys revealed it needed a complete
OL,9,Frebuild.
OL,11,FThe pool at Kingfisher Leisure Centre
OL,12,Fin Sudbury, Suffolk, had been due to
OL,13,Fundergo #875,000 of repairs and
OL,14,Fmaintenance to keep the 39-year-old
OL,15,Ffacility going for a few more years.
OL,17,FOwner Barbergh District Council said
OL,18,Fthis was no longer viable, with the
OL,19,Fpool, sauna and jazuzzi closed with
OL,20,Fimmediate effect.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
