OL,3,GNEWSAAgeing swimming pool closes over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is deeply disappointing that we
OL,7,Fhave to close the pool, but we must put
OL,8,Fthe safety of swimmers first," said
OL,9,FLaura Smith, cabinet member for
OL,10,Fthriving communities.
